config BR2_PACKAGE_EASYSTICK_BOOT_COMMIT
	bool "EasyStick boot image A/B commit helper"
	help
	  Installs the privileged helper that copies a validated 256 KiB boot
	  image to PSRAM and publishes a CRC-protected commit request for the
	  boot shim.  The shim applies the image to its inactive flash slot on
	  the next normal reboot.
